#: ../../source/docs/watchdog-debugging.rst:5 40c86d6882a7436ea069aef046bb1a02
msgid "Debugging Watchdog Reset Events"
msgstr "调试看门狗复位事件"

#: ../../source/docs/watchdog-debugging.rst:7 d7973f8fd04a4121bf65eb09483eae33
msgid ""
"We attempt to provide as much information as we can about watchdog reset "
"events in the onboard logs and via our telemetry streams.  This document "
"outlines ways in which you can use that information to root-cause the issue "
"causing the watchdog."
msgstr "我们尝试在板载日志和数传流中提供尽可能多的关于看门狗复位事件的信息。本文档概述了您可以如何使用这些信息来找出导致看门狗触发的根本原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/watchdog-debugging.rst:13
#: 3179fe90c0db4b3e843f7ae8e3f242fb
msgid "The ``decode_watchdog.py`` Utility"
msgstr "``decode_watchdog.py`` 工具"

#: ../../source/docs/watchdog-debugging.rst:15
#: e7ba96cd4684412da6375f61bed011b9
msgid ""
"A Python script is provided in ArduPilot's Tools directory.  A string from "
"either a telemetry log or an onboard log can be passed in to this script and"
" it spits human-readable information out on stdout."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 的 Tools 目录中提供了一个 Python "
"脚本。来自数传日志或板载日志的字符串可以传递给此脚本，它会在标准输出上输出人类可读的信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/watchdog-debugging.rst:26
#: 64fb205b66a04c3b8fd2f0aec163e4b9
msgid "Understanding the T (thread) field"
msgstr "理解 T（线程）字段"

#: ../../source/docs/watchdog-debugging.rst:28
#: c27f3f6190374ec680daa0a160a2da5e
msgid ""
"This is an offset into the scheduler table, which is a combination of "
"vehicle-specific tasks and general system tasks.   It can be found in the "
"@SYS/tasks.txt file which can be retrieved from the vehicle, and found in "
"dataflash logs."
msgstr ""
"这是调度器表中的偏移量，调度器表是飞行器特定任务和通用系统任务的组合。它可以在可从飞行器获取的 @SYS/tasks.txt 文件中找到，也可在 "
"dataflash 日志中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/watchdog-debugging.rst:30
#: fcadb1d5a8254a4088275f72509352b3
msgid "There are three magic tasks:"
msgstr "有三个特殊任务："

#: ../../source/docs/watchdog-debugging.rst:38
#: cc2cb30d3cf34359b412f78772d336d1
msgid ""
"If in state -3 then the code was almost certainly in an interrupt handler "
"when the fault occured."
msgstr "如果状态为 -3，则代码在发生故障时几乎可以肯定处于中断处理程序中。"

#: ../../source/docs/watchdog-debugging.rst:41
#: 24f4c9518d7449dcb16e7b0252594c8c
msgid "Converting the LR field into a line of code"
msgstr "将 LR 字段转换为代码行"

#: ../../source/docs/watchdog-debugging.rst:43
#: 109fbd5160d644868fe4eeceae9a8573
msgid ""
"Certain faults will fill the Function Level Reset (FLR) register with the "
"address of an instruction which caused the processor to fault.  That address"
" can be turned into a line of code."
msgstr "某些故障会将函数级复位（FLR）寄存器填充为导致处理器故障的指令地址。该地址可以转换为代码行。"

#: ../../source/docs/watchdog-debugging.rst:45
#: c69d78b1aa634bfc9975690b7e16713f
msgid "Ensure you can identically reproduce the binary running on the board."
msgstr "确保您可以完全相同地重现板上运行的二进制文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/watchdog-debugging.rst:46
#: c631ba71a1b34e74b616ea0ed47898f5
msgid "Try addr2line"
msgstr "尝试 addr2line"

#: ../../source/docs/watchdog-debugging.rst:47
#: b145f50aa60a41b48095153cb1b160de
msgid ""
"disassemble the binary: arm-none-eabi-objdump --demangle --disassemble-all "
"--full-contents --all-headers"
msgstr ""
"反汇编二进制文件：arm-none-eabi-objdump --demangle --disassemble-all --full-contents "
"--all-headers"
